1
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:09,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Everyone's responsible
for copyright protection.]</font>

2
00:00:09,310 --> 00:00:14,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪After all the joy and sorrow♪</font>

3
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:18,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I still recall your face♪</font>

4
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪You were by my side;
the cool rain fell♪</font>

5
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:30,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I closed my eyes
and heard you sing gently♪</font>

6
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:36,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'd wager all
for a love that never ends♪</font>

7
00:00:37,150 --> 00:00:40,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪To keep you forever near♪</font>

8
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:47,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In this vast world,
I wait for your light♪</font>

9
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:52,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll share this dream
till dawn is bright♪</font>

10
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:58,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪All the riddles of parting
I'll uncover♪</font>

11
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:01,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪At last, I'll sing, kiss, and hold you♪</font>

12
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:04,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The answer is revealed
within your heart♪</font>

13
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:12,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Legendary Chitose-Sama]</font>

14
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:16,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 30]</font>

15
00:01:16,960 --> 00:01:17,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao,</font>

16
00:01:18,040 --> 00:01:18,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">your former subordinates</font>

17
00:01:19,480 --> 00:01:20,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">caused the border unrest,</font>

18
00:01:21,200 --> 00:01:22,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">had Guanzhou soldiers
surround the granary,</font>

19
00:01:22,440 --> 00:01:24,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and made Meng Xi pressure me, right?</font>

20
00:01:24,880 --> 00:01:25,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you doing?</font>

21
00:01:26,040 --> 00:01:26,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you planning a rebellion?</font>

22
00:01:27,640 --> 00:01:29,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All I seek is the truth.</font>

23
00:01:29,800 --> 00:01:30,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What truth?</font>

24
00:01:31,240 --> 00:01:31,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Five years ago,</font>

25
00:01:32,640 --> 00:01:34,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my family was struck
by the Bloodlure Poison.</font>

26
00:01:35,480 --> 00:01:36,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The case is full of doubts.</font>

27
00:01:37,760 --> 00:01:39,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I beg you to order
a thorough investigation.</font>

28
00:01:39,840 --> 00:01:41,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That case was long settled.</font>

29
00:01:41,720 --> 00:01:42,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was the work of Xizhao spies.</font>

30
00:01:43,080 --> 00:01:43,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What more is there to investigate?</font>

31
00:01:45,240 --> 00:01:46,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have shown you leniency,</font>

32
00:01:46,480 --> 00:01:47,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">pardoning the Qin family's treason.</font>

33
00:01:48,600 --> 00:01:49,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What more could you possibly want?</font>

34
00:01:54,040 --> 00:01:56,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have uncovered new leads
on the Bloodlure Poison.</font>

35
00:01:57,120 --> 00:01:59,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Imperial Physician
who treated my family</font>

36
00:01:59,040 --> 00:01:59,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is now under strong suspicion.</font>

37
00:02:01,400 --> 00:02:02,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Moreover, the true mastermind</font>

38
00:02:05,040 --> 00:02:06,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">remains at large.</font>

39
00:02:11,160 --> 00:02:11,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right now,</font>

40
00:02:12,200 --> 00:02:13,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't wish to hear another word.</font>

41
00:02:13,440 --> 00:02:14,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Get out of my sight!</font>

42
00:02:17,760 --> 00:02:18,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you command it,</font>

43
00:02:20,440 --> 00:02:21,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I shall take my leave.</font>

44
00:02:40,200 --> 00:02:41,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You heard all that?</font>

45
00:02:42,840 --> 00:02:44,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan is outrageously bold,</font>

46
00:02:45,280 --> 00:02:47,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">daring to threaten me directly.</font>

47
00:02:48,160 --> 00:02:49,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Utterly despicable.</font>

48
00:02:49,880 --> 00:02:50,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Majesty, please calm your anger.</font>

49
00:02:51,880 --> 00:02:53,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan currently holds</font>

50
00:02:53,600 --> 00:02:54,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">no real power in his hands.</font>

51
00:02:55,840 --> 00:02:58,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me persuade his former subordinates.</font>

52
00:02:58,760 --> 00:03:00,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He won't be able to stir up any trouble.</font>

53
00:03:01,760 --> 00:03:02,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know Prince Duan's character.</font>

54
00:03:03,760 --> 00:03:04,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If this matter goes uninvestigated,</font>

55
00:03:05,760 --> 00:03:06,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he will not back down.</font>

56
00:03:08,080 --> 00:03:10,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since these former subordinates
dared to bring this to me,</font>

57
00:03:11,680 --> 00:03:13,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they must be desperate now.</font>

58
00:03:15,160 --> 00:03:16,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm afraid what you propose</font>

59
00:03:16,960 --> 00:03:18,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is not the best solution.</font>

60
00:03:21,120 --> 00:03:22,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Majesty,</font>

61
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:25,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have you reached a decision?</font>

62
00:03:29,080 --> 00:03:30,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If Beiyuan were to fall</font>

63
00:03:30,960 --> 00:03:32,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">into internal strife now,</font>

64
00:03:33,320 --> 00:03:35,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it would invite invasion
from the border states.</font>

65
00:03:36,880 --> 00:03:38,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The realm of Beiyuan comes first.</font>

66
00:03:39,320 --> 00:03:40,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And besides, Master,</font>

67
00:03:40,960 --> 00:03:41,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you are advanced in years.</font>

68
00:03:43,120 --> 00:03:44,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You have devoted your life to Beiyuan,</font>

69
00:03:44,920 --> 00:03:45,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">toiling tirelessly for it.</font>

70
00:03:47,080 --> 00:03:48,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It is time you enjoyed
your well-earned retirement.</font>

71
00:03:50,160 --> 00:03:51,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wouldn't you say</font>

72
00:03:52,400 --> 00:03:53,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this is the best of both worlds?</font>

73
00:04:05,640 --> 00:04:06,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Majesty,</font>

74
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:09,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I understand.</font>

75
00:04:13,840 --> 00:04:15,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The art of governance lies in balance.</font>

76
00:04:15,960 --> 00:04:17,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To preserve the greater good,</font>

77
00:04:17,400 --> 00:04:18,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">one must sacrifice the chariot
to save the commander.</font>

78
00:04:21,240 --> 00:04:21,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Master,</font>

79
00:04:23,120 --> 00:04:24,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">this is what you taught me.</font>

80
00:04:33,160 --> 00:04:34,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've served</font>

81
00:04:34,200 --> 00:04:37,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">as Duke Dingguo for 35 years.</font>

82
00:04:37,720 --> 00:04:41,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The late emperor entrusted me
with great affairs on his deathbed.</font>

83
00:04:42,160 --> 00:04:43,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Five years ago,</font>

84
00:04:43,840 --> 00:04:46,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in the case of rooting out Xizhao spies,</font>

85
00:04:46,640 --> 00:04:48,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I acted with reckless audacity,</font>

86
00:04:48,680 --> 00:04:49,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">blinded by greed and desire.</font>

87
00:04:50,920 --> 00:04:52,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To protect my power and interests,</font>

88
00:04:53,400 --> 00:04:54,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I unleashed a massacre,</font>

89
00:04:55,720 --> 00:04:57,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">causing the family
of the Guanzhou Governor</font>

90
00:04:57,880 --> 00:04:59,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to suffer a grave injustice,</font>

91
00:05:00,240 --> 00:05:02,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and all of Prince Duan's family
to die wrongly.</font>

92
00:05:03,240 --> 00:05:05,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I know my crimes are beyond measure.</font>

93
00:05:06,000 --> 00:05:08,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I submit to the judgment
of Beiyuan's law.</font>

94
00:05:08,720 --> 00:05:10,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This is to clear the names
of the Qin and Li families.</font>

95
00:05:12,200 --> 00:05:13,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let my example serve</font>

96
00:05:13,760 --> 00:05:14,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">as a warning to future generations</font>

97
00:05:15,960 --> 00:05:16,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and a lesson</font>

98
00:05:17,560 --> 00:05:19,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to all officials.</font>

99
00:05:35,200 --> 00:05:35,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father.</font>

100
00:05:50,080 --> 00:05:50,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yufan,</font>

101
00:05:53,560 --> 00:05:54,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I leave our family</font>

102
00:05:56,760 --> 00:05:57,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in your hands.</font>

103
00:06:18,960 --> 00:06:19,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yufan.</font>

104
00:06:20,720 --> 00:06:22,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My sins are grave.</font>

105
00:06:22,800 --> 00:06:24,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The deeds I have done</font>

106
00:06:24,040 --> 00:06:25,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">must be judged by the law.</font>

107
00:06:27,080 --> 00:06:29,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I hope you will learn from my fall,</font>

108
00:06:29,720 --> 00:06:31,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">establish yourself with virtue,</font>

109
00:06:31,920 --> 00:06:33,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and fulfill your destiny with talent.</font>

110
00:06:43,280 --> 00:06:43,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Father!</font>

111
00:07:20,480 --> 00:07:21,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Greetings,</font>

112
00:07:22,320 --> 00:07:23,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

113
00:07:24,400 --> 00:07:25,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Spare me this act.</font>

114
00:07:28,240 --> 00:07:29,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you think your imprisonment alone</font>

115
00:07:30,600 --> 00:07:32,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can put an end to this matter?</font>

116
00:07:41,680 --> 00:07:42,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you know</font>

117
00:07:43,120 --> 00:07:45,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who truly made the decision?</font>

118
00:07:46,800 --> 00:07:47,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who else could it be?</font>

119
00:07:49,240 --> 00:07:50,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was the late emperor.</font>

120
00:07:51,720 --> 00:07:53,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">On his deathbed, he told me</font>

121
00:07:54,560 --> 00:07:55,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to always be on guard</font>

122
00:07:56,200 --> 00:07:57,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">against your family.</font>

123
00:07:58,560 --> 00:08:00,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The late emperor and my father</font>

124
00:08:00,920 --> 00:08:02,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">fought side by side.</font>

125
00:08:02,680 --> 00:08:04,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They won the realm together.</font>

126
00:08:04,960 --> 00:08:06,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's exactly why</font>

127
00:08:06,800 --> 00:08:08,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he had no choice but to fear you.</font>

128
00:08:10,120 --> 00:08:11,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The late emperor had to be wary,</font>

129
00:08:11,720 --> 00:08:13,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and what I saw was</font>

130
00:08:13,480 --> 00:08:16,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the Yangming Army
obeying only your father.</font>

131
00:08:16,200 --> 00:08:18,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And you were formidable
on the battlefield.</font>

132
00:08:20,240 --> 00:08:21,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">With the Qin and Li families eliminated,</font>

133
00:08:21,480 --> 00:08:23,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I would stand second only to the throne,</font>

134
00:08:23,360 --> 00:08:24,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">above all others.</font>

135
00:08:24,640 --> 00:08:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, I simply</font>

136
00:08:26,280 --> 00:08:28,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">wiped them out.</font>

137
00:08:28,480 --> 00:08:29,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Overshadowing the sovereign</font>

138
00:08:30,440 --> 00:08:32,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is just your fabricated charge.</font>

139
00:08:33,440 --> 00:08:35,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When has my family
ever wavered in loyalty?</font>

140
00:08:35,160 --> 00:08:36,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hearts change with time.</font>

141
00:08:37,640 --> 00:08:40,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How can the realm's fate rest
on mere trust?</font>

142
00:08:42,280 --> 00:08:43,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

143
00:08:44,120 --> 00:08:45,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">the dead are gone.</font>

144
00:08:46,280 --> 00:08:47,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have already</font>

145
00:08:48,080 --> 00:08:49,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">confessed to all my crimes.</font>

146
00:08:52,040 --> 00:08:53,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You put the realm first,</font>

147
00:08:55,440 --> 00:08:56,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">yet you fell so low.</font>

148
00:08:58,360 --> 00:08:59,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Was it worth it?</font>

149
00:09:26,800 --> 00:09:28,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Qin and Li families were wiped out.</font>

150
00:09:28,600 --> 00:09:29,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Innocent lives were slaughtered.</font>

151
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:31,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was ennobled as the Prince</font>

152
00:09:31,680 --> 00:09:33,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">all because of one man's paranoia.</font>

153
00:09:33,960 --> 00:09:36,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is there any justice left in this world?</font>

154
00:09:39,640 --> 00:09:40,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness, receive the decree.</font>

155
00:09:46,560 --> 00:09:49,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">By the Grace of Heaven,
the Emperor decrees:</font>

156
00:09:49,840 --> 00:09:52,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let the Qin family's injustice
be known to all.</font>

157
00:09:53,280 --> 00:09:55,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bestow upon Qin Minzhi
the posthumous title Wenzheng,</font>

158
00:09:56,280 --> 00:09:58,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and upon his wife,
First-Rank Lady of Honor.</font>

159
00:09:59,040 --> 00:10:00,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Grant an inscription
to the late Prince Duan:</font>

160
00:10:01,640 --> 00:10:04,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Serving and bringing blessings
to the land.</font>

161
00:10:05,120 --> 00:10:06,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Thus decreed.</font>

162
00:10:08,880 --> 00:10:09,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Prince Duan.</font>

163
00:10:10,760 --> 00:10:11,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Accept the decree.</font>

164
00:10:28,160 --> 00:10:31,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Prince Duan's Mansion]</font>

165
00:10:37,800 --> 00:10:38,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've finished writing.</font>

166
00:10:40,920 --> 00:10:42,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The world is vast.</font>

167
00:10:42,600 --> 00:10:43,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wish to journey forth.</font>

168
00:10:45,440 --> 00:10:45,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do you think?</font>

169
00:10:46,320 --> 00:10:48,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I racked my brains for these words.</font>

170
00:10:49,640 --> 00:10:50,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Allow me.</font>

171
00:11:12,600 --> 00:11:15,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[I quit]</font>

172
00:11:17,760 --> 00:11:18,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're truly free-spirited.</font>

173
00:11:23,520 --> 00:11:24,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I</font>

174
00:11:24,720 --> 00:11:26,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">let my family down in the end.</font>

175
00:11:29,400 --> 00:11:30,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Justice will prevail in the end.</font>

176
00:11:36,200 --> 00:11:36,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness,</font>

177
00:11:37,280 --> 00:11:38,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when do we depart for Xizhao?</font>

178
00:11:38,840 --> 00:11:42,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Prince's Residence]</font>

179
00:11:50,680 --> 00:11:51,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You are all dismissed.</font>

180
00:12:09,760 --> 00:12:10,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mobai,</font>

181
00:12:11,160 --> 00:12:13,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">after many days apart,
I've missed you dearly.</font>

182
00:12:13,920 --> 00:12:15,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Bloodlure Poison case
has been fully investigated.</font>

183
00:12:16,400 --> 00:12:17,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It was indeed Duke Dingguo's doing.</font>

184
00:12:19,000 --> 00:12:20,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our family's name has been cleared
before the world.</font>

185
00:12:21,800 --> 00:12:23,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Duke Dingguo has been stripped
of his title</font>

186
00:12:23,880 --> 00:12:24,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and thrown into prison.</font>

187
00:12:25,240 --> 00:12:27,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We wished to depart
right after the Prince resigned.</font>

188
00:12:28,600 --> 00:12:30,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But he insists</font>

189
00:12:30,200 --> 00:12:32,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">on holding our grand wedding</font>

190
00:12:32,160 --> 00:12:33,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">before we set out.</font>

191
00:12:33,960 --> 00:12:34,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I hope you'll understand.</font>

192
00:12:36,240 --> 00:12:38,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I look forward to our reunion in Xizhao.</font>

193
00:12:39,160 --> 00:12:39,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Looking forward to our meeting.</font>

194
00:12:41,200 --> 00:12:42,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's only been a few months,</font>

195
00:12:43,200 --> 00:12:44,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">yet everything has changed.</font>

196
00:13:13,040 --> 00:13:14,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You</font>

197
00:13:15,320 --> 00:13:15,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have received</font>

198
00:13:16,160 --> 00:13:17,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">news from Beiyuan, right?</font>

199
00:13:18,320 --> 00:13:19,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've been spying on me?</font>

200
00:13:19,960 --> 00:13:21,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your residence</font>

201
00:13:21,200 --> 00:13:23,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is filled with spies from every faction.</font>

202
00:13:23,560 --> 00:13:25,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am not the only one.</font>

203
00:13:28,920 --> 00:13:30,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's someone from Noble Consort Xiao,</font>

204
00:13:30,680 --> 00:13:31,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Vice Minister Liu,</font>

205
00:13:32,760 --> 00:13:34,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and General Xu.</font>

206
00:13:36,600 --> 00:13:37,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And also,</font>

207
00:13:37,960 --> 00:13:39,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">someone from the Chengtian Sect.</font>

208
00:13:48,440 --> 00:13:49,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What is the meaning of this?</font>

209
00:13:49,480 --> 00:13:49,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My son.</font>

210
00:13:51,280 --> 00:13:53,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You should call me Father.</font>

211
00:13:54,800 --> 00:13:56,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Though the time we have spent</font>

212
00:13:56,280 --> 00:13:57,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">together has been short,</font>

213
00:13:58,240 --> 00:13:58,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you are</font>

214
00:13:59,640 --> 00:14:01,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my only son.</font>

215
00:14:02,480 --> 00:14:03,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In the future,</font>

216
00:14:03,640 --> 00:14:05,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you are to inherit the throne.</font>

217
00:14:06,280 --> 00:14:08,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you don't understand
the art of court politics,</font>

218
00:14:09,800 --> 00:14:11,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how can I be at ease</font>

219
00:14:11,920 --> 00:14:14,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">entrusting the realm to your hands?</font>

220
00:14:14,920 --> 00:14:16,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This identity was forced upon me by you.</font>

221
00:14:17,280 --> 00:14:18,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All I want is to be a commoner.</font>

222
00:14:18,880 --> 00:14:19,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you know</font>

223
00:14:20,400 --> 00:14:22,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">why I have so few heirs?</font>

224
00:14:23,480 --> 00:14:24,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Because the Chengtian Sect</font>

225
00:14:25,440 --> 00:14:26,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">controls my harem.</font>

226
00:14:27,320 --> 00:14:29,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They poisoned my consorts,</font>

227
00:14:29,480 --> 00:14:30,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and that's not all.</font>

228
00:14:30,960 --> 00:14:31,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They</font>

229
00:14:32,520 --> 00:14:34,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">also poisoned my three sons.</font>

230
00:14:35,760 --> 00:14:37,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They poisoned me as well.</font>

231
00:14:37,680 --> 00:14:38,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That is why</font>

232
00:14:39,080 --> 00:14:40,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my health</font>

233
00:14:40,720 --> 00:14:42,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">has deteriorated to this state.</font>

234
00:14:43,960 --> 00:14:44,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't the Chengtian Sect</font>

235
00:14:46,240 --> 00:14:47,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">just a religious order?</font>

236
00:14:47,960 --> 00:14:49,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You don't understand.</font>

237
00:14:50,120 --> 00:14:51,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Their strength lies</font>

238
00:14:52,000 --> 00:14:53,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in poisoning minds.</font>

239
00:14:54,640 --> 00:14:55,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even though I know</font>

240
00:14:56,320 --> 00:14:59,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they've infiltrated the imperial family,</font>

241
00:14:59,640 --> 00:15:00,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there is no one by my side</font>

242
00:15:01,360 --> 00:15:03,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">whom I can truly trust.</font>

243
00:15:05,480 --> 00:15:06,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My son,</font>

244
00:15:07,440 --> 00:15:08,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in the end,</font>

245
00:15:09,200 --> 00:15:11,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what will become of us?</font>

246
00:15:15,280 --> 00:15:17,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You should think long and hard about it.</font>

247
00:15:24,280 --> 00:15:25,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You are still far too naive.</font>

248
00:15:26,640 --> 00:15:28,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Once you return,
you will come to understand.</font>

249
00:15:28,880 --> 00:15:30,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In the court,</font>

250
00:15:31,880 --> 00:15:33,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there is no such thing as retreat.</font>

251
00:15:52,160 --> 00:15:52,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yufan,</font>

252
00:15:52,680 --> 00:15:53,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how did it go?</font>

253
00:15:53,920 --> 00:15:54,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't ask.</font>

254
00:15:55,160 --> 00:15:56,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They are all a bunch of snobs.</font>

255
00:15:57,080 --> 00:15:59,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Before, they bowed
and scraped at our door.</font>

256
00:15:59,600 --> 00:16:00,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now that Father is in trouble,</font>

257
00:16:00,640 --> 00:16:01,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I went to beg for their help,</font>

258
00:16:02,080 --> 00:16:03,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and every one of them shut me out.</font>

259
00:16:04,880 --> 00:16:05,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yufan,</font>

260
00:16:06,000 --> 00:16:07,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">should we pay someone
to stage a prison break?</font>

261
00:16:07,600 --> 00:16:08,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Ying, think</font>

262
00:16:08,520 --> 00:16:09,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">before you speak.</font>

263
00:16:10,240 --> 00:16:10,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you forcing me</font>

264
00:16:10,960 --> 00:16:12,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to have you escorted out of Yanjing?</font>

265
00:16:12,760 --> 00:16:13,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No, Yufan, listen.</font>

266
00:16:13,880 --> 00:16:14,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We can't just let Father</font>

267
00:16:14,880 --> 00:16:16,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">rot in prison forever.</font>

268
00:16:17,120 --> 00:16:18,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You know what that place is like.</font>

269
00:16:19,400 --> 00:16:20,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In his condition,</font>

270
00:16:20,520 --> 00:16:21,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">how could he possibly endure it?</font>

271
00:16:23,720 --> 00:16:24,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm working on it.</font>

272
00:16:25,360 --> 00:16:26,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will find a way.</font>

273
00:16:26,400 --> 00:16:27,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Truly?</font>

274
00:16:27,480 --> 00:16:28,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What way?</font>

275
00:16:30,720 --> 00:16:31,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Things will get better.</font>

276
00:16:32,240 --> 00:16:33,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I promise you.</font>

277
00:16:36,240 --> 00:16:40,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Duke Dingguo's Mansion]</font>

278
00:16:40,160 --> 00:16:41,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Eunuch Li has arrived.</font>

279
00:16:46,680 --> 00:16:47,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Greetings, Eunuch Li.</font>

280
00:16:48,120 --> 00:16:49,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Greetings, Mr. Jiang.</font>

281
00:16:49,680 --> 00:16:50,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What brings you here?</font>

282
00:16:51,040 --> 00:16:52,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">His Majesty summons your sister.</font>

283
00:16:53,400 --> 00:16:55,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Miss Jiang, please come with me
to the Palace at once.</font>

284
00:16:56,680 --> 00:16:57,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm summoned?</font>

285
00:17:01,530 --> 00:17:03,390
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll see all the world's sights♪</font>

286
00:17:04,400 --> 00:17:05,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Drifting with the clouds♪</font>

287
00:17:06,070 --> 00:17:09,370
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Leave our names etched
in each other's hearts♪</font>

288
00:17:09,990 --> 00:17:14,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Bright as a goddess, stirring my soul♪</font>

289
00:17:14,670 --> 00:17:17,970
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Each stroke inscribed
into the passing years♪</font>

290
00:17:18,660 --> 00:17:22,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪A sky full of stars covers
the peach blossom spring♪</font>

291
00:17:23,180 --> 00:17:27,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪With you, hand in hand
across the vast world♪</font>

292
00:17:27,510 --> 00:17:33,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No words needed,
our hearts mirror each other♪</font>

293
00:17:35,650 --> 00:17:39,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Catching a teardrop on my fingertip♪</font>

294
00:17:40,320 --> 00:17:43,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Then gently caressing your face♪</font>

295
00:17:44,370 --> 00:17:48,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We await mercy
as the rain flutters down♪</font>

296
00:17:48,920 --> 00:17:51,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪This floating life
is like a myriad of dreams♪</font>

297
00:17:52,890 --> 00:17:57,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No matter how far the journey,
our passion endures♪</font>

298
00:17:57,500 --> 00:18:01,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Let's turn a blind eye
to all the gossip and rumors♪</font>
